    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bakhaana babili babooni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi amboolela ali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwana wo mundu, babao bakhasi babili, boombi baba bakhaana bo muloosi mulala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu buele bwabwe ne basimenyile e Misiri, batibia buyabwana bwabwe mala baaba baeeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lisina lio mukhulu liaba bali Ohola ne omutiiti aaba bali Oholiba. Bekela babaase mala basaala basoleeli ne bakhaana. Ne khulwe kamasina kabwe, Ohola ali Samaria ne Oholiba ali Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ohola akhola bueeyi ne ali owase mala asiima batia bewe Baashuru, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naitiriani babefwarire chingubo chimbuusi, babaami bakhulu nende banaitiriani be kamalaka, baele basiimisia boosi, batimia chifarasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abengisia mu bueeyi bwewe. Babaandu barobore ba Ashuru boosi, mala eefwolobia ne bifwaani bioosi bia buli mundu niye aasiima khuuba omutia wewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Se aalekha bueeyi bwewe nibwo aaba ne akholile khukhwama mu ndaalo chewe mu Misiri tawe, sikila mu buele bwewe babaandu bakona naye ne khunyaalutia buyabwana bwewe, ne khukhwolesia liliekoomba liabwe likali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako namwakaanisia mu makhono ke Baashuru, nibo niye aaba omutia wabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaandu bano bamufuula chingubo, baamba babaana bewe basoleeli ne bakhaana, mala niye omwene bamwiira ne mbalu. Siuukuumo siewe esio siaaba khu lulimi lwa buli mukhasi buli abuundu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omukooko wewe Oholiba abona kano, ne kakhaba kario aakhola bumayaanu bukali khukhila bwo mukooko wewe mu khusiima batia mu bueeyi bwewe, aaba omumayaanu khukhila omukooko wewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asiima Baashuru babaami bakhulu, naitiriani be kamalaka, naitiriani bafwara chingubo chimbuusi be bibioki mu bwichufu, batimia chifarasi, boosi baaba babaandu basiimisia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne nabona ndi ali omumayaanu lukali, ng'ali boombi baaba ne kumwiima mulala okwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ne kakhali niye aabisiao mala aacha aleeyi lukali mu bueeyi. Aabona bifwaani bie babaandu biaandikwa khu lisiisi, bifwaani bie Bakalitayo bibiaandikwa mu bubesemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beboa chikhoba munda, ne bileemba khu mirwe kiabwe. Boosi babonekha nga bakhulu be bunyali, sifwaanani sie Bababiloni babeene be sibala sia Kalutayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga ne aababona, aabasiima mala aaruma barumwa khu nibo mu Kalutayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bababiloni becha niio ali, bacha naye mu sitanda sie butia mala bamukhola sifwabi ne liliekoomba liabwe. Ne nga baaba ne bamalile khumufwolobia mu bueeyi, aabakaluukhanakho aababiila lukali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga ne achiililila mu bueeyi bwewe abuwaanga lukali, efuula ekesia sichula siewe, namubiila bulayi bwene busa nga nabiila omukooko wewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhaba kario atasa bueeyi bwewe khukhila mu ndaalo che buele bwewe nga ne akholanga bueeyi mu sibala sia Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asiimisibwa ne batia benabo ebweeneyo ba baaba ne kimibili nga kie chipunda, namwe kamaani ke busecha nga chifarasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako wekoomba sifwabi sie buele bwowo, Bamisiri bakhurumikhira mala bonakaka buyabwana bwowo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bukhalaki bwa Wele khu mukooko omuro",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako Ee, Oholiba, Omwami WELE aloma ali, “Lola ese ndenyosia basaale bowo nibo ewe wakaluukhanakho wabiila mala ndabareera khukhwama buli lubeka bakhubiile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaandu nga Bababiloni ne Bakalitayo boosi, Bapekoti, ne Bashoa ne Bakoa ne Baashuru boosi alala. Baele basiimisia, babaami bakhulu, naitiriani be kamalaka lukali, boosi barangisi nende naitiriani boosi batimia chifarasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basiku balakhwibwaakala ewe khukhwama e bunaswa alala ne kamakaari ke liie ne kamakaari ke khusuta bibiindu ne babaandu be chikholo bakhabalikha tawe. Balakhwibwaakala khukhwama buli lubeka ne bibiindu bie khukhweteecha, chingabo ne chikofio che sichuuma che khumurwe. Ese khabaelesie bunyali bwe bukhalaki, mala balakhukhalakila khuloondekhana ne bukhalaki bwabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikila ndi ne lirima nawe, ndabalekha bakhukholele ke bukhalafu, Balakhukhala kamoolu ne kamaru, mala beere babaana bowo baramire ne mbalu. Balaamba babaana bowo basoleeli ne bakhaana, ne baramire balosebwa ne kumulilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akhaba lundi balakhufuula chingubo mala bakhunuule bilayi nibio wisaanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako ndakamia liliekoomba liowo lie bukhobani ne bueeyi bwowo nibwo wamia mu sibala sia Misiri nio okhaloleelela lundi Bamisiri, namwe wabakhebulilakho lundi tawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako Omwami WELE aloma ali, “Lola ndakhuana khu baandu nibo ewe wabiila waukhakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne sikila bakhubiila ewe, balakhuyaaya buli siindu nisio wanyaakhana wanyoola, mala bakhunuule bakhwanjukhe busa ne oli sichula, sichula sie bueeyi silabonekha. Liliekoomba liowo lie bukhobani ne bueeyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "biakhurereere kano, sikila waeeyana ne chikholo mala wekhola sifwabi khulwe bifwaani biabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ewe waloonda mu lung'afuulo lwo mukooko wowo. Khwako ndakhuukuuma ne siuukuumo siewe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako Omwami WELE aloma ali,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako Omwami WELE aloma ali, “Sikila ewe wanjibiliile ese ne khukhuumwaata ekoongo, khwako khosute busiro bubwama mu likoomba liowo lie sifwabi ne bueeyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Likhalaka lia Wele khu bakooko boombi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi amboolela ali, “Mwana wo mundu, ewe onyala wakhalakila Ohola ne Oholiba ku? Nono baboolele abuwaanga bikholwa biabwe bimayaanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikila bakholile bueeyi ne sifuki sie bubwiri sili mu makhono kabwe. Lundi bakholile bueeyi ne bifwaani biabwe, ne akhaba lundi baana basoleeli babwe nibo basaala khwise nga embosio eye siakhulia khu bifwaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khutasa khwako, lundi bakholeele kano: Bafwolobie Lukaangu lwase lutakatifu, ne khu ndaalo ne ng'ene bafufuule chisabato chase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikila nga ne baaba ne beerire babaana babwe nibo baana nga embosio khu bifwaani biabwe, ne khu ndaalo ne ng'ene becha mu Lukaangu lwase khulufwolobia!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Baruma omurumwa khulaanga babaandu be siseecha khukhwama aleeyi, ne lola becha. Sikila nibo, wesiinga, werona sia moni mala wefwara kamamili ke bukusi bwe angaaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikhalanga khu sitanda silayi lukali ne mesa yalilwe ebweeni wasio nikhwo warengekha bupani bwase ne kamafura kase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luyoka lwe babaandu bakali babesangaasiisie lwauliilikha niio ali ne babaandu bakhali ne lukoosi tawe, bameesi ba busiele, bareerwa khukhwama mu sichiimi, bafwara bakhasi abo chipangili khu makhono ne khubafwara chikuutwa chichang'oonwa bulayi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nono ese nareeba ndi, ‘Eku, balakhola bukhobani no mukhasi oweele sio sikila khukhola bueeyi?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikila baba naye nga baseecha ne baba no mukhasi omutamba. Khwako bacha bario khu Ohola nende khu Oholiba bakhasi babelekhuula abo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne babaandu baluungi bakhabekiiche babakhalakile ne likhalaka lie bukhobani ne bukhalaki bwe bakhasi babeeri bachukhanga sifuki sikila bali bakhobani ne sifuki sie bubwiri sili khu makhono kabwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko kakila Omwami WELE ne aloma ali, “Reera kiminjoloolo kie babaandu kibebwaakale kibarengie ne khubayaaya kimiaandu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiminjoloolo kie babaandu kilabapa kamabaale ne khubabunia ne mbalu, kileera babaana babwe basoleeli nende bakhaana ne khukhwosia chinju chabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ngila ng'eneyo khakamie bueeyi mu sibala nio bakhasi boosi boole khukaambilwa bakhakhola bueeyi nga enywe ne mwakholile tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne enywe mulatiuukhwa busiro bwe bueeyi bwenywe ne khusuta kumuruungo kwe bumayaanu bwe khusaaya bifwaani mala mulamanya muli ese ndi Omwami WELE.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
